-- F32 (2026-10-19 stress test) regression: an invalid OPTIONS value is an
-- error, never a silent default (HEADER MAYBE used to behave as HEADER NO).
-- Run with -k so each failing step is reported and the script continues.
OPTIONS HEADER MAYBE
OPTIONS SAVEOVERWRT 2
OPTIONS IEEE_DIVIDE 2
OPTIONS PROGRESS maybe
OPTIONS WARNRESERVED perhaps
OPTIONS TXTFMT XYZ
OPTIONS CHARSET NOPE
OPTIONS CSVDLM ""
OPTIONS DEBUG 99
OPTIONS MAXINTAB abc
OPTIONS HEADER YES
OPTIONS TXTFMT crlf
OPTIONS CHARSET UTF-8
OPTIONS TXTFMT AUTO
OPTIONS CHARSET AUTO
